{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1120603001:0":{"text":"说，英灵卡斯特的宝藏在哪？","source_cn":"说，英灵卡斯特的宝藏在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8031B5DC35DA2F7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120603002:0":{"text":"快说，别想着逃跑！","source_cn":"快说，别想着逃跑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DE76C6B73FD25EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120603003:1":{"text":"不，你们听、听我说……真的没有什么宝藏……我发誓！那……那都是我编出来的故事啊……","source_cn":"不，你们听、听我说……真的没有什么宝藏……我发誓！那…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8922266346CD9C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120603004:1":{"text":"编的故事？嘿，你倒是挺嘴硬的。","source_cn":"编的故事？嘿，你倒是挺嘴硬的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC3CD6719E4A2A93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120603005:1":{"text":"这是你兄弟吧？你要是不说实话……我就把他捆起来丢进荒漠里。","source_cn":"这是你兄弟吧？你要是不说实话……我就把他捆起来丢进荒漠里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x137560F31584DD2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:11